      | 012345 | 20312015.. |
---------------------------------------------------------------------
0     |   0    | 0          | use empty #2 as DATA0
1     | 1 0    | 01         | use empty #0 as DATA1
2     | 1 02   | 012        | use empty #3 as DATA2
